    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Trigger</strong> Lich Faltyr is targeted by a ranged strike.</p>\n<hr />\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Effect</strong> Lich Faltyr waves a hand over his face revealing a ghostly mask. Each enemy must succeed at a @Check[type:Reflex|dc:34|name:Ghostly Visage] save to avert their gaze or find that a mask has formed on their face as well.</p>\n<p><strong id=\"docs-internal-guid-170b8fb6-7fff-d7ca-73b7-2ee4bf34fea1\"> Critical Success </strong>The creature is unaffected.<strong id=\"docs-internal-guid-170b8fb6-7fff-d7ca-73b7-2ee4bf34fea1\"><br />Success </strong>The creature is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TkIyaNPgTZFBCCuh]{Dazzled} for 1 round.<strong id=\"docs-internal-guid-170b8fb6-7fff-d7ca-73b7-2ee4bf34fea1\"><br />Failure </strong>The creature is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.XgEqL1kFApUbl5Z2]{Blinded} for 1 round.<strong id=\"docs-internal-guid-170b8fb6-7fff-d7ca-73b7-2ee4bf34fea1\"><br />Critical Failure </strong>The creature is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.XgEqL1kFApUbl5Z2]{Blinded} for 1 round and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TkIyaNPgTZFBCCuh]{Dazzled} for 1 minute.</p>"
